876	   * <p><b>Java 21+ users:</b> if {code iterable} is a {@code SequencedCollection} (e.g., any list),
877	   * consider using {@code collection.getLast()} instead. Note that if the collection is empty,
878	   * {@code getLast()} throws a {@code NoSuchElementException}, while this method returns the
879	   * default value.
