590	   * inner lists of three and two elements, all in the original order.
591	   *
592	   * <p>The returned lists implement {@link java.util.RandomAccess}.
593	   *
594	   * <p><b>Note:</b> The current implementation eagerly allocates storage for {@code size} elements.
595	   * As a consequence, passing values like {@code Integer.MAX_VALUE} can lead to {@link
596	   * OutOfMemoryError}.
597	   *
598	   * @param iterator the iterator to return a partitioned view of
599	   * @param size the desired size of each partition (the last may be smaller)
600	   * @return an iterator of immutable lists containing the elements of {@code iterator} divided into
601	   *     partitions
602	   * @throws IllegalArgumentException if {@code size} is nonpositive
603	   */
